  "details": "Until a portable mirror option is implemented, it could be an acceptable workaround. \nBasically having a button that would turn the camera screen into a mirror: \n- increase the camera screen size to a mirror size\n- place it a few meters away from the viewpoint\n- auto turn the camera to face the avatar\nIt's pretty easy to implement\nas it's just a resize and coordinate placement of the existing screen. \nbeing able to configure the size and distance through simple json settings in the config file would be a plus\nor have buttons in the main camera menu to set the size / distance of the new \"mirror mode\"\nThanks",
